  Save for later.

  A star was doing this job and a heart was doing "more like this", which in most apps mean
  the same thing: both are marks of approval, and neither says which one comes back later.
  A bookmark says only that, and says nothing about whether the reader liked it.

  Drawn rather than imported: the project uses material-icons-core, which has no bookmark,
  and the extended set is several thousand icons to gain one. Corners and notch are rounded
  to sit beside the heart rather than against it.
-->
